      description: "Pioneer of the local music scene since the early 1980s. Consistent entertainer at leading venues throughout Byron Bay, Gold Coast, and Brisbane.",
      fullDescription: "As a long-time resident of the Byron Bay region, Barry established himself as a pioneer of the local music scene in the early 1980s, becoming a consistent and popular entertainer at all the leading local venues and on the Gold Coast & in Brisbane for over four decades. He performs regularly as a soloist and in an interesting variety of musical combinations, and has had great success as an entertainer for many beautiful Byron Bay weddings.",
